    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι-πρόσωπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>two-faced,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαλμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					1.16.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτήριον, σκάφιον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(4).1308
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1309
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ambiguous,</i>
