				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>denoting two persons,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				17.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				110.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπρόσωπος, ἡ,</span> name of a <i>plaster,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.127
			</span></i>.</div>
